 "brief": {
  "short_answer": "When signal is lost, the aircraft should follow pre-programmed loss-of-signal procedures (RTH, hover, or land) and seek to reestablish link if possible. FAA guidance emphasizes attempting to reestablish the control link, then executing emergency/contingency procedures; if VLOS cannot be regained, follow pre-determined loss-of-VLOS procedures. Transfers of control between remote pilots must maintain VLOS.",
  "sections": [
   {
    "section": "faa",
    "label": "FAA guidance",
    "status": "no_evidence",
    "abstain_reason": "no claims in the single-pass brief",
    "claims": []
   },
   {
    "section": "manual:DJI Matrice 30T",
    "label": "DJI Matrice 30T manual",
    "status": "drafted",
    "abstain_reason": null,
    "claims": [
     {
      "text": "If the remote controller signal is lost, the aircraft will follow loss-of-signal procedures and may enter RTH or other preset actions per settings.",
      "citations": [
       "faa_ac_107_2a_2022_c0032",
       "dji_m30t_manual_v22_c0033"
      ],
      "quote": "The action of the aircraft when the remote controller signal is lost can be set to RTH, land, or hover in Camera View > > > Signal Lost Action in DJI Pilot 2.",
      "conditions": [],
      "assessment": "supported",
      "claim_id": "C001",
      "section": "manual:DJI Matrice 30T",
      "tier": "manufacturer",
      "incident_label": null
     },
     {
      "text": "DJI Matrice 30T provides RTH can be triggered when signal is lost, with RTH path shown if lighting allows; it may enter Original Route RTH if vision systems are unavailable.",
      "citations": [
       "dji_m30t_manual_v22_c0033",
       "dji_m30t_manual_v22_c0032"
      ],
      "quote": "The action of the aircraft when the remote controller signal is lost can be set to RTH, land, or hover in Camera View > > > Signal Lost Action in DJI Pilot 2. The aircraft will start RTH using Advanced RTH according to the RTH settings.",
      "conditions": [],
      "assessment": "supported",
      "claim_id": "C002",
      "section": "manual:DJI Matrice 30T",
      "tier": "manufacturer",
      "incident_label": null
     }
